{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>On the graph chart which point has coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/862245421e2a459d7e4103c37bb8392ab64018d5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5, 1)?$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:1963_Algebra_I_22.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/c/c3/1963_Algebra_I_22.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"297\" height=\"296\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/2/452b59a27877a37a09ed2c148969c2926cd35865.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad A \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad B \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad C \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad D \\quad \\text{(E)} \\quad E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"346\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/f/c5fc882426065b23b4633cdaf750076e8d77b326.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(-5, 1,)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"61\" height=\"18\" /> start from the origin and move <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> units left and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> unit up. This is marked by the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/6/ef683aad527e25f8b8892d72a7b86cd5c13c6fe7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{D}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"31\" height=\"24\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_20\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 20\"> Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_22\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017041827\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.022 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 60/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1174/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.326      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    6.326      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20665:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017041827 and revision id 144621. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}